{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>11月12日，針對網絡流傳的「騰訊將裁員50%」消息，騰訊公司公關總監張軍在微博發文闢謠，稱這是「純純的誤會和謠言」。</strong>張軍還原稱，在騰訊28周年Linktime線上直播中，管理層表達了加快組織變革的決心，並特別説明這與幾年前「降本增效」不同——前一次相對被動、更偏「降本」，此次是面向AI時代的主動出擊，更偏「增效」，鼓勵一線同事積極舉手向前衝，中間管理層則需變得更扁平和靈敏。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586046.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.456052+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:19:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"4d7875d5b444c80afc180c1c385035c75a204fcda007ad76e0e486bf57660bb3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}